<div class="page-body wrap-narrow">
  <h1>Unsubscribe</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every email we send includes an unsubscribe link at the bottom. One click removes you from the list.</p>
  <p>If you can’t find it, send a message through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> with the email address you subscribed with, choosing “Something else”, and you’ll be removed manually.</p>
